<title>USA: Great Lakes REIT sets $0.30/shr qrtly div.</title>
<headline>Great Lakes REIT sets $0.30/shr qrtly div.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Great Lakes REIT Inc said Friday its board of directors set a quarterly dividend of $0.30 a share, payable June 30 to shareholders of record on June 13.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust had its initial public offering in May.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
